# ==============================================================================
# NEXUS Root .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# --- External / Large Runtime Dependencies & Local User Data (see AGENTS.md) ---
/Engine/
/Models/
/nexus_data/
/Backups/
/OpenMausBot-main/
/Nexus-CSharp/docs/
**/nexus_data/

# --- .NET / Visual Studio Build Artifacts ---
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/bin-*/
**/obj-*/
**/.nexus-verification/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
publish/

# --- Backups, Temporary Files & Logs ---
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
*.swp
*~

# --- Python Cache ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# --- OS / Editor Artifacts ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Secrets / Certificates (safety guard) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
*.key
